- [N5] Node-level mutation: element=action(n8,"You have completed this procedure"); source=i11:After the invoice has been handled, the process comes to an end.; reason=Replaces the source's procedural conclusion with an invented user-facing confirmation message ('You have completed this procedure'), drifting from the original meaning and tone.
